{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"The standard ZXQPH0000QXZ deck is distributed equally. Each player has to sell ZXQPH0001QXZ-ZXQPH0002QXZ tokens; a successful zero token earns ZXQPH0003QXZ, and a failed zero token loses ZXQPH0004QXZ. Team contracts are added to their non-zero tokens: the ZXQPH0005QXZ points for each token, plus one bag for each additional token; missing it, each token loses ZXQPH0006QXZ points.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"spades-game UI copy.fields.rulesText","detected_language":"zh","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"spades-game.copy.fields.rulesText","keys":["spades-game.copy.fields.rulesText"],"locale":"zh-TW","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"標準的ZXQPH0000QXZ牌組是平均分配的。 每個玩家都要出售ZXQPH0001QXZ-ZXQPH0002QXZ的招牌;成功的零招牌得分為ZXQPH0003QXZ,失敗的零招牌失去ZXQPH0004QXZ。 隊伍合同加上他們的非零招牌:每個招牌的ZXQPH0005QXZ點數,加上每個額外招牌的一個袋子;錯過它,每個招牌失去ZXQPH0006QXZ點數。 每累積十個袋子減去ZXQPH0007QXZ點數。","record_id":"f668ac06ffd335688a96dea91217105b27c4669d5c6ee3bcb4e55ce025b49686","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":4.510047379749992,"source":"The standard 52-card deck is dealt evenly. Each player bids 0–13 tricks; a successful nil bid scores 100 and a failed nil loses 100. Team contracts add their non-nil bids: make the total for 10 points per bid, plus one bag for each extra trick; miss it and lose 10 points per bid. Every ten accumulated bags subtract 100 points. Players must follow the suit led when possible. Spades cannot be led until broken unless a player holds only spades, and a spade beats any non-spade card.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"b070b3bdbe8ea9a514fbc13b545bd851619f9a66b846fe5b4b157ec211a4c86c","status":"needs-review","translation":"標準的52牌組是平均分配的。 每個玩家都要出售0-13的招牌;成功的零招牌得分為100,失敗的零招牌失去100。 隊伍合同加上他們的非零招牌:每個招牌的10點數,加上每個額外招牌的一個袋子;錯過它,每個招牌失去10點數。 每累積十個袋子減去100點數。","truncated":false,"warnings":["back_data","back_negation"]}
